From 1fe0ae9540944f13b6bb16aa968daec777c22087 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 16:13:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Desktop tests: pin 15 surviving mutants from the
 #2287/#2289/#2323/#2336/#2337 post-merge checks

Test-only, plus one stale comment. Post-merge checks t_01a1d585805480d4 and
t_01a1d59498376333 found mutants of merged code that every existing test
survived. Each new test fails on its mutant alone and passes on main
(sdlc-review mutants.py over idle-motion-pause, session-status-dot,
session-dot-state and api.events-cursor: baseline 125 passed, 15/15 killed).

#2287 rowExecutionStores() (session-status-dot.test.tsx):
- M3h/M3i: an existing tile that gains its owner, or an owner tile rebound to
  the row, repaints at once (the $tileOwnerBindings key covers owner and ids).
- M3b: a primary re-home publishes its new profile after the epoch bump, so
  only $activeGatewayRoute sees the new roster source.
- M3c: a same-profile re-activation notifies only $gatewayActivationEpoch; an
  owner hint (module state) is picked up there.
- M3d-M3g: a running process counts toward a row only once a cron / messaging
  / project-tree / unlisted-stub row (a lineage tip of the session) names its
  owner. Rendered through useSessionDotState, because the dot itself also
  subscribes $sessionColorById, which repaints on any project-tree change and
  masked M3f.

#2323/#2337 IdleMotionPause (idle-motion-pause.test.ts):
- M1d: a stale-sheet removal that throws synchronously no longer stops the
  reload's re-apply.
- M2337d: a window that loads after resume gets no sheet.

#2289/#2336 kanban events coalescing (api.events-cursor.test.ts):
- M5e: dispose drops a pending trailing refresh.
- M5d: a new binding's first frame re-reads at once even inside the last
  binding's interval (a binding the host never disposed).
- M2336d: one in-flight wait per key, however many trailing refreshes land.
- M2336e: a deferred re-read starts the interval over.
- M2336h: the Blocked section read is neither cancelled nor duplicated.

api.ts: the onEventsFrame docstring named 8 s / 4 s polls; the fallbacks are
board 15 s across gateways else 60 s, drawer task 30 s, log 3 s running else
15 s (promised in the #2289 thread, comment 6856061185).
